"ingredientId":"sal","quantity":null,"unit":null,"toTaste":true,"optional":false,"group":{"es":"Para la bechamel","en":"For the béchamel"},"note":null,"sourceText":"Sal"},{"ingredientId":"pimienta","quantity":null,"unit":null,"toTaste":true,"optional":false,"group":{"es":"Para la bechamel","en":"For the béchamel"},"note":null,"sourceText":"Pimienta"},{"ingredientId":"mantequilla","quantity":30,"unit":"g","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":{"es":"Para la bechamel","en":"For the béchamel"},"note":null,"sourceText":"30 g de mantequilla"},{"ingredientId":"tomillo","quantity":null,"unit":null,"toTaste":true,"optional":false,"group":{"es":"Para la bechamel","en":"For the béchamel"},"note":null,"sourceText":"Tomillo"},{"ingredientId":"nuez-moscada","quantity":null,"unit":null,"toTaste":true,"optional":false,"group":{"es":"Para la bechamel","en":"For the béchamel"},"note":null,"sourceText":"Nuez moscada"},{"ingredientId":"cebollino","quantity":null,"unit":null,"toTaste":true,"optional":false,"group":{"es":"Para la bechamel","en":"For the béchamel"},"note":null,"sourceText":"Cebollino"},{"ingredientId":"harina","quantity":30,"unit":"g","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":{"es":"Para la bechamel","en":"For the béchamel"},"note":null,"sourceText":"30 g de harina"}],"steps":[{"text":{"es":"Troceamos en tres partes los croissants. Batimos los huevos con la leche, una pizca de tomillo, pimienta, sal y nuez moscada.","en":"Cut the croissants into three pieces. Beat the eggs with the milk, a pinch of thyme, pepper, salt and nutmeg."}},{"text":{"es":"En un cazo derretimos la mantequilla y añadimos la harina para tostarla. Vertemos la leche poco a poco, removemos con unas varillas para que no queden grumos. Sazonamos con sal, pimienta y nuez moscada.","en":"In a saucepan, melt the butter and add the flour to toast it. Pour in the milk a little at a time, whisking so no lumps form. Season with salt, pepper and nutmeg."}},{"text":{"es":"Bañamos los croissants en la mezcla de huevo y leche y colocamos una primera capa en una fuente de horno apta para la Cecofry, añadimos la mitad de jamón de york, la mitad del queso emmental en daditos y un poco de queso rallado.","en":"Dip the croissants in the egg and milk mixture and arrange a first layer in an ovenproof dish suitable for the Cecofry, add half the ham, half the diced emmental cheese and a little grated cheese."}},{"text":{"es":"Ponemos el resto de croissants, jamón york, queso emmental y queso rallado, agregamos unas cucharadas de bechamel y cocinamos a 170ºC durante 20 minutos.","en":"Add the rest of the croissants, ham, emmental cheese and grated cheese, add a few spoonfuls of béchamel and cook at 170 °C for 20 minutes."},"timerMinutes":20,"temperatureC":170},{"text":{"es":"Servimos con un poco de cebollino.","en":"Serve with a little chive."}}]}